        "job": "Add a paid plan's counted prices (storage above what it includes) to a person's subscription on this service's Stripe account, and send each day's count of what they keep above it",
        "description": "Runs only on this service's operator account. A paid checkout or renewal starts it to add the plan's counted prices to the subscription (src/payment.mjs startPlanUsage); each paying account's store starts it once a day with that day's count (src/plan-usage.mjs). Uses the operator's Stripe connection; nothing is counted while the subscription is in its free trial or after it ends, and each day's count carries its own identifier so it is counted once.",
